  "goodToKnow": "Diesbezüglich means in this regard or concerning this, and it's a hallmark of official German: Diesbezüglich verweisen wir auf unsere AGB. Ihre diesbezügliche Anfrage means your enquiry about this. It's built from dies (this) and bezüglich (regarding), which itself takes the genitive: bezüglich Ihrer Anfrage. In speech, Germans say dazu or was das angeht instead. Overusing it makes writing sound like a tax office letter."
